SDL3: Switch 2 controllers over USB on macOS

The NSO GameCube controller (057E:2073) showed up with driver = NONE on macOS: SDL opens Switch 2
controllers only through libusb, and macOS's HID driver holds their HID interface, which libusb can't
detach without root. apply-sdl3-macos-switch2-usb.cmake (run in the vendored SDL's patch step) reads
them through IOKit on macOS and gives the Switch 2 driver its own libusb handle for the bulk interface.

